ptrue predicate as counter 
Initial is e predicate as counter to all active 
Set the destination predicate as all active elements using the predicate as counter encoding 

SVE2 
(FEAT_SVE2p1) 








Encoding 

PTRUE < PNd > . < T> 


Decode for this encoding 

